          <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="_R71qCxCoEfCxXpi0wJwkWw" annotatedElement="_R71qChCoEfCxXpi0wJwkWw">
            <body>Directory where temporary files may be created.
L_tmpnam = size of P_tmpdir
*            + 1 (in case P_tmpdir does not end in \&quot;/\&quot;)
*            + 12 (for the filename string)
*            + 1 (for the null terminator)

Seek method constants
Define NULL pointer value
Declare _iob[] array
Buffered I/O macros

* Default number of supported streams. _NFILE is confusing and obsolete, but
* supported anyway for backwards compatibility.


* Number of entries in _iob[] (declared below). Note that _NSTREAM_ must be
* greater than or equal to _IOB_ENTRIES.
</body>
          </ownedComment>
